            <note corresp="#pm_d7-f2" n="2" xml:id="pm_d7-f2-content">
                <p>Printed in <ref target="frus1955-57v07#d167"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                            Relations</hi>, 1955–1957, vol. VII, American Republics: Central and
                        South America, Document 167</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#pm_d7-f3" n="3" xml:id="pm_d7-f3-content">
                <p>The following handwritten notation appears at the bottom of the source text:
                    “Note: This is an example of what happens to many an issue we take up with a
                    foreign government on behalf of the Defense establishment. W[illiam]. P. Snow
                    10/7/8”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
